  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaotanzhi-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaotanzhi-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="ur9_mm4_0ny_AA">蕭坦之</persName>，南蘭陵蘭陵人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaotanzhi-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="ur9_mm4_0ny">道濟</persName>，太中大夫。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaotanzhi-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="ur9_mm4_0ny_A">欣祖</persName>，有勳於<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xiaotanzhi-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>，至武進令。</p>
